package CanvasNet {
    part def ShapeLibrary {
        doc /* The internal static ShapeLibrary (a partial class: the entry point and style split, the classic and bracket shapes, the extended Mermaid shapes, the image and icon shapes, the intersect functions, the path parts and drafts, and the subgraph rectangle) with its value types ShapePoint, NodeBox, ShapeIntersect, NodePaint, ShapeTheme, ShapeContext, ShapeResult, and ClusterShape, and the shape registry ShapeNames (the 53 documented shapes with their short names, aliases, and internal aliases, and the undocumented shapes, with a case-sensitive IsKnown, HandlerOf, and the Nearest accepted name for a typo): a port of Mermaid's rendering-elements/shapes in the classic look. Draw measures the label through ShapeContext.MeasureLabel (labelHelper), computes the geometry from the label box, the padding, and the direction of the graph with Mermaid's formulas, paints the parts with the cascade of the style sheet's node rule, the node's own styles (styles2String split into label and node styles; declarations outside the CSS subset reported as mermaid-style-ignored), and the theme colors, and returns the drawn items, the box of everything drawn (the node size for the layout, as insertMeasuredNode), the label and its place, and the intersect function (rectangle, ellipse, circle, line, and polygon with Mermaid's arithmetic and quirks). Image nodes are sized from the natural size of NodeImages, w, h, and the aspect constraint; icons are not drawn but counted as a square of their size; rough.js circles are true circles; the legacy ellipse of A(-text-) is drawn as an ellipse; a shape of another diagram type fails with a located mermaid-render-failed that suggests a documented shape. DrawCluster draws the subgraph rectangle of clusters.js widened to its title. The class is stateless and safe for concurrent use. */

        comment sourceRef /* Source: src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Mermaid/Rendering/ShapeLibrary.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Mermaid/Rendering/ShapeLibrary.Basic.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Mermaid/Rendering/ShapeLibrary.Extended.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Mermaid/Rendering/ShapeLibrary.Images.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Mermaid/Rendering/ShapeLibrary.Intersect.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Mermaid/Rendering/ShapeLibrary.Parts.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Mermaid/Rendering/ShapeLibrary.Clusters.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Mermaid/Rendering/ShapeNames.cs */
        comment testRef /* Test: test/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Mermaid.Tests/Rendering/ShapeLibraryTests.cs, test/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Mermaid.Tests/Rendering/ShapeLibraryVectorTests.cs, test/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Mermaid.Tests/Rendering/ShapeNamesTests.cs */
        comment designRef /* Design: docs/design/canvas-net-mermaid/rendering/shape-library.md */
        comment verificationRef /* Verification: docs/verification/canvas-net-mermaid/rendering/shape-library.md */
        comment reqRef /* Requirements: docs/reqstream/canvas-net-mermaid/rendering/shape-library.yaml */
    }
}
